Let the subarray be $S = \{x_1, x_2, \dots, x_m\}$ where $m = R - L + 1$. Since the original array is sorted, $S$ is also sorted. We want to select $2K$ elements and partition them into $K$ pairs $(u_i, v_i)$ such that $u_i \le v_i/2$. We want to maximize $K$.
